<!-- obot3, exported from the Fusion model obot3_claude build v32 by tools/urdf_export.py.  Do not edit: regenerate.
     x forward, y left, z up.  All joints 0 = the pose the CAD model is drawn in (upper arm upright, forearm
     and tool pointing forward).  Arm joint angles have the sign of the CAD model (tools/pose.py):
       shoulder_pitch +back / -forward,  elbow_pitch +up,  wrist_pitch +up,  wrist_roll right-handed about x.
     left_wheel is the robot's own left (+y); the CAD model calls that side R.
     Masses marked ASSUMED in tools/urdf_export.py are not weighed (battery, hub motors, tyres, caster wheels,
     gripper allowance).  Cables are not included.  Collision = boxes and cylinders round the big bodies. -->
